insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The new system was adopted not because it was cheaper, but because it made the process more transparent in public institutions, as described in a committee meeting in a northern language center context.','The new system was rejected because it was not transparent.','The process became less transparent after the new system was adopted.','The main reason for adopting the new system was improved transparency rather than lower cost.','The new system was adopted mainly because it reduced costs.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_32", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'Even though the experiment was small, its results raised important questions for future research during periods of change, as described in a student guide in a southern language center context.','The experiment was too large to raise useful questions.','The results were ignored because the experiment was not small.','Future research became unnecessary after the experiment.','Despite its limited size, the experiment produced results that future studies should examine.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_32", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction in small communities, as described in a pilot study in a central language center context.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_32", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed when resources are limited, as described in a professional workshop in a online language center context.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_32", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change under careful supervision, as described in a policy review in a evening language center context.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_32", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability after initial trials, as described in a classroom discussion in a summer language center context.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_32", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
